From 7b3694c8161066cd2b7d38703006e8aabfbdbc90 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: atomozero <bernardi.andrea@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 07:20:26 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 38/63] nvec: driver for the embedded controller of the Toshiba
 AC100

The NVIDIA embedded controller protocol over the Tegra I2C slave: the
keyboard, the touchpad, the battery and the power supply, the power
button, the lid and the backlight keys; it switches the machine off and
unmutes the speakers at start, as Linux does. It recovers from a lost
interrupt, a touchpad that reset itself and an EC that stops answering.

/dev/misc/nvec_diag passes requests to the EC for the ac100ec tool.

Signed-off-by: atomozero <bernardi.andrea@gmail.com>
